  "label": "User projected onto the child questioning teeth",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the child in the image, who is the subject of the question 'do i have something in my teeth?'. The use of 'i' in the text creates a direct deictic reference, implying that the viewer (user) is identifying with the child as the speaker. The child's joyful expression and the text create an analogical mapping where the user is positioned as the 'I' in the question, projecting themselves onto the child's visual and textual representation.",
